sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Engine as Producer<br/>(anomaly-detector)
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>(smartload.anomaly)
    participant Dispatcher as webhook-<br/>dispatcher
    participant DB as webhooks table<br/>+ webhook_delivery_failures
    participant Customer as Customer<br/>webhook URL

    Engine->>Redis: PUBLISH AnomalyEvent envelope
    Redis-->>Dispatcher: SUBSCRIBE delivers envelope
    Dispatcher->>DB: SELECT webhooks WHERE event_type<br/>= 'anomaly' AND tenant_id = $1
    DB-->>Dispatcher: rows (url, secret, scopes)
    loop For each registered webhook
        Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: Compute HMAC-SHA256<br/>X-SmartLoad-Signature
        Dispatcher->>Customer: POST <url> (signed)
        alt Success (2xx)
            Customer-->>Dispatcher: 200 OK
            Dispatcher->>DB: UPDATE last_delivery_at
        else Failure (4xx/5xx/timeout)
            Customer-->>Dispatcher: error
            Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: Exponential backoff<br/>(up to 5 attempts ~10 min)
            alt Final failure
                Dispatcher->>DB: INSERT webhook_delivery_failures
                Dispatcher->>Redis: emit dispatcher metric
            end
        end
    end
